    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0004",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p103-03848-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Aren’t these activities all what the philosopher Blaise Pascal would have called “diversions”?",
      "sentenceSha256": "8d6f535dbbccde1d6a6ca1a5d01a82830453e657512ecb3565d3b54919f458c7",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p103-03848-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-002",
      "parentFingerprint": "fac907321c2858bc5ff1f6b369ed533bd313bfe946766ed8d3e359a37273ed56",
      "passageSha256": "6528adfb7e46087cffe70d122d5a97d7ba409bcee1849cda570278c37ad43de2",
      "pdfPages": [
        103
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0005",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p103-03848-s008",
      "sentenceText": "In other words, what is the point of exploration?",
      "sentenceSha256": "b434c68e1a2e290569b33911513538f20e92d027f348f2b6f935b2906a377235",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p103-03848-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-002",
      "parentFingerprint": "fac907321c2858bc5ff1f6b369ed533bd313bfe946766ed8d3e359a37273ed56",
      "passageSha256": "6528adfb7e46087cffe70d122d5a97d7ba409bcee1849cda570278c37ad43de2",
      "pdfPages": [
        103
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0006",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p103-05212-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Nature may have an answer.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0142f413c34e2835ae7c37801deaabfd8339df177e35191f0a71e05964ebba0d",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p103-05212-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-003",
      "parentFingerprint": "e787083e8019e8b55250cbf4e91dca7633bfae2f401124c69b2e3980b8b3c481",
      "passageSha256": "efe1cde4b05ed73f4d1f57de6fb148f897d55fc23267558f853bf7f9bd5587a8",
      "pdfPages": [
        103
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0007",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p103-05212-s002",
      "sentenceText": "The great tit (Parus major) is a bird in the tit family Paridae, about five inches in length.",
      "sentenceSha256": "86bae3eda828939d72b35c44e8b96887ad0433e540ebffaf20136c4746f2f178",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p103-05212-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-003",
      "parentFingerprint": "e787083e8019e8b55250cbf4e91dca7633bfae2f401124c69b2e3980b8b3c481",
      "passageSha256": "efe1cde4b05ed73f4d1f57de6fb148f897d55fc23267558f853bf7f9bd5587a8",
      "pdfPages": [
        103
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0008",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p103-05212-s003",
      "sentenceText": "It is a common species in Europe, North Africa, the Middle East, and Central Asia.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a90d11664d5418e15f72492c9f7f1efe5950cbaf92f9b606a7934ac22c4fba04",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p103-05212-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-003",
      "parentFingerprint": "e787083e8019e8b55250cbf4e91dca7633bfae2f401124c69b2e3980b8b3c481",
      "passageSha256": "efe1cde4b05ed73f4d1f57de6fb148f897d55fc23267558f853bf7f9bd5587a8",
      "pdfPages": [
        103
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0009",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p103-05212-s005",
      "sentenceText": "When one patch was far better than the other (e.g., 50 percent difference in food availability), the great tits explored a bit (about ten hops), figured out which one was better, and stuck with the better one, or “exploited” it.",
      "sentenceSha256": "033bab26f5c3936767962cef8e16cea5d72b49e9c1e37eebd411812c8cf2e9b9",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p103-05212-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-004",
      "parentFingerprint": "fd8053aeaef3f1257355847e3df8268bd981ea81d5baf1600dc492a2c495ff8c",
      "passageSha256": "230202d401bb9636674d563b9bca60570a4503e81e615488caa16af47c43ec00",
      "pdfPages": [
        103,
        104
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0010",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p104-01140-s001",
      "sentenceText": "The scientists also ran computer simulations and compared simulated optimal results with the actual experimental data from the great tits.",
      "sentenceSha256": "5a73f5b9f786b77cfe90fb9d067ef19bad0b6c28437bc02e9cf47abaecb31379",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p104-01140-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-005",
      "parentFingerprint": "b6457f924ecc0575b5fa313e1cdb64a82aa58c250398988641054562841c8a25",
      "passageSha256": "bf09c7593960f563e0e5091c7122f7535bb20c318b8dc5704b8a5eafee5255d9",
      "pdfPages": [
        104
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0011",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p104-02310-s001",
      "sentenceText": "By definition, a psychologically rich life leans toward “exploration” strategies rather than “exploitation” strategies.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f2e67123404005a7b0d3cb37f8905bc1afc93501ca2468595cc34ba6ce526deb",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p104-02310-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-006",
      "parentFingerprint": "836ec4241065f04560c0c73e02d083e0b7ebf9c76a70c501f053ce9c006b4c51",
      "passageSha256": "49e4c0e1db67fc53a009c1061613c291509223d2bfecfe71f76c5406a974cfb9",
      "pdfPages": [
        104
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0012",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p104-02310-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Like the great tits, people seem to vary their strategies according to their circumstances.",
      "sentenceSha256": "6529bbf43a1a0491ee261394a6155d22a834a53a55a5b44bef77dc5fd71e5958",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p104-02310-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-006",
      "parentFingerprint": "836ec4241065f04560c0c73e02d083e0b7ebf9c76a70c501f053ce9c006b4c51",
      "passageSha256": "49e4c0e1db67fc53a009c1061613c291509223d2bfecfe71f76c5406a974cfb9",
      "pdfPages": [
        104
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0013",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p104-05048-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Among sophomores, a happy life was the top answer, followed by a psychologically rich life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "72ff4cf37a392c202afbab59cd1a33f696d8581d5664f0540213b2bbbb4b1d02",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p104-05048-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-007",
      "parentFingerprint": "ae25edd3ad8acdd6d40b7e197c156d420ee8fe497ee9dffbce4219fe9314d113",
      "passageSha256": "6ffa745accdc2232315990b84ab6f2facbd3bd1e66e8d5d3ad8f364b69e13f53",
      "pdfPages": [
        104
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0014",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p104-05048-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Among juniors, all three options were equally attractive.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1070273de6824af82569ea796cbfae0bc28d0637eda0e6bb116896dc2da83fbf",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p104-05048-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-007",
      "parentFingerprint": "ae25edd3ad8acdd6d40b7e197c156d420ee8fe497ee9dffbce4219fe9314d113",
      "passageSha256": "6ffa745accdc2232315990b84ab6f2facbd3bd1e66e8d5d3ad8f364b69e13f53",
      "pdfPages": [
        104
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0015",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p104-05048-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Finally, among seniors, a meaningful life was the most popular, closely followed by a happy life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8a23a717e9f8f9ae2c5263e85c6a863cf47be64e7f028a28965930d4d75e8c07",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p104-05048-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-007",
      "parentFingerprint": "ae25edd3ad8acdd6d40b7e197c156d420ee8fe497ee9dffbce4219fe9314d113",
      "passageSha256": "6ffa745accdc2232315990b84ab6f2facbd3bd1e66e8d5d3ad8f364b69e13f53",
      "pdfPages": [
        104
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0016",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s01-p104-05048-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Early on, many college students prefer exploration.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b96e2640bbc7451263a05fbd0c5515297808de86bb92b00977bedc7788d3d392",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s01-p104-05048-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-008",
      "parentFingerprint": "ea452ef0893c13c9faf2663aca4a145d9606aea9023a4e00c8ebdc5cf2cd7040",
      "passageSha256": "240ab8b2939a9f93e98d2e1e3cb44bf40537c5a52d49c1c25afedfb3ea3fdb40",
      "pdfPages": [
        104
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0017",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s02-p105-00982-s001",
      "sentenceText": "But are these UVA students following the optimal strategy?",
      "sentenceSha256": "bec9b30e725c133372e871911180a8f49817ce036f360d8fb8aaefc27a8ab9ca",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s02-p105-00982-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-009",
      "parentFingerprint": "fdc1ae499e91c679bd47b0fb33a6bfb7dbd30cbb4a520375f5757b73ac1633ac",
      "passageSha256": "a1c6710d408c74f6fc3f3bb03c1c07d14a88c37dfdd0d608e3d50b0957907cc5",
      "pdfPages": [
        105
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0018",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s02-p105-00982-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Do humans use the optimal exploration-exploitation strategy in general?",
      "sentenceSha256": "f4e9edcf585060f518976a85031840827d5c99208cba5cc7b7152aea6b2485b7",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s02-p105-00982-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-009",
      "parentFingerprint": "fdc1ae499e91c679bd47b0fb33a6bfb7dbd30cbb4a520375f5757b73ac1633ac",
      "passageSha256": "a1c6710d408c74f6fc3f3bb03c1c07d14a88c37dfdd0d608e3d50b0957907cc5",
      "pdfPages": [
        105
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0019",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s02-p105-00982-s004",
      "sentenceText": "They authored a fun and informative article entitled “From Pride and Prejudice to Persuasion: Satisficing in Mate Search.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "a7d6aa6dafda64df0aa7716db7562bb473047d7e272ef54af0f34d383254a8c3",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s02-p105-00982-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-009",
      "parentFingerprint": "fdc1ae499e91c679bd47b0fb33a6bfb7dbd30cbb4a520375f5757b73ac1633ac",
      "passageSha256": "a1c6710d408c74f6fc3f3bb03c1c07d14a88c37dfdd0d608e3d50b0957907cc5",
      "pdfPages": [
        105
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0020",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s02-p105-02348-s001",
      "sentenceText": "The chapter starts with the story of Johannes Kepler, a German astronomer and mathematician.",
      "sentenceSha256": "6661e56202892b4ae8ef52d1e260a23e64ec33a233074fef4874e304a3e1b24d",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s02-p105-02348-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-010",
      "parentFingerprint": "f43af152f0b0551f592818f71006bd51e59b84fdb8c0cab499d5318aee414558",
      "passageSha256": "c09471f55078a34b67aafb15c4a69e22fea7ed7e7586d7278a1f5edf51b4c12e",
      "pdfPages": [
        105
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0021",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s02-p105-02348-s002",
      "sentenceText": "His first wife died of cholera in 1611; Kepler did not mourn much, as his first marriage was not a happy one.",
      "sentenceSha256": "229394139815a8c0f22020f55afd1e2ddd649fb6f1fb23e727e4f9673bee00cd",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s02-p105-02348-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-010",
      "parentFingerprint": "f43af152f0b0551f592818f71006bd51e59b84fdb8c0cab499d5318aee414558",
      "passageSha256": "c09471f55078a34b67aafb15c4a69e22fea7ed7e7586d7278a1f5edf51b4c12e",
      "pdfPages": [
        105
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0022",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s02-p105-02348-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Soon afterward, he began a methodical search for a new wife.",
      "sentenceSha256": "89aa69a0254ca2c5acae4a8ef141dd2bb5e6891e0db9999d907b8d6e975f8e19",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s02-p105-02348-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-010",
      "parentFingerprint": "f43af152f0b0551f592818f71006bd51e59b84fdb8c0cab499d5318aee414558",
      "passageSha256": "c09471f55078a34b67aafb15c4a69e22fea7ed7e7586d7278a1f5edf51b4c12e",
      "pdfPages": [
        105
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0023",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s02-p105-02348-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Friends urged him to choose candidate number four, a woman of high status and large dowry.",
      "sentenceSha256": "995f84744bc4e9423f399fcb96a0af4dde764e3be5fd60f8585d3eb2b3f2601b",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s02-p105-02348-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-011",
      "parentFingerprint": "0000139834761bcabec1bd9396ddf8df734357c1d68e2d81f19ea382a520dcdc",
      "passageSha256": "3f8be545e8a0bdb160b56aa04de2e8139f89960255d6b1e07436cb71282ffc14",
      "pdfPages": [
        105
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0024",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s02-p105-02348-s007",
      "sentenceText": "So he went with his personal favorite, candidate number five.",
      "sentenceSha256": "288ed9a6929df997f25e3b1b2eb1dd2e3992be442330e89777e27b4106a08740",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s02-p105-02348-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-011",
      "parentFingerprint": "0000139834761bcabec1bd9396ddf8df734357c1d68e2d81f19ea382a520dcdc",
      "passageSha256": "3f8be545e8a0bdb160b56aa04de2e8139f89960255d6b1e07436cb71282ffc14",
      "pdfPages": [
        105
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0025",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s02-p105-02348-s008",
      "sentenceText": "Though she was not from the wealthiest family, she was well educated and is thought to have provided favorable domestic conditions for Kepler to produce four more major works.",
      "sentenceSha256": "45baec5928f98ef54367d0c18f19dec306cc0c7c5d42daea997c2dfa920ca189",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s02-p105-02348-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-011",
      "parentFingerprint": "0000139834761bcabec1bd9396ddf8df734357c1d68e2d81f19ea382a520dcdc",
      "passageSha256": "3f8be545e8a0bdb160b56aa04de2e8139f89960255d6b1e07436cb71282ffc14",
      "pdfPages": [
        105
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0026",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s02-p105-04882-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Kepler was the leading mathematician of his time, so he probably had a very good sense of probability theorems.",
      "sentenceSha256": "6fc3c901eb7256814f9a0a269605da65f1c04a196952479d0a0e5563feff2f78",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s02-p105-04882-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-013",
      "parentFingerprint": "7acf48a34556cbada096158e29e6011bbaa265a847ad20a495ce3421511cef6a",
      "passageSha256": "669c07c00e1c0b53fcbeb61f4e7ce6b279e820e369fef9564bb9d28d84e8d02d",
      "pdfPages": [
        105
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0027",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s02-p105-04882-s002",
      "sentenceText": "In statistics, there is a famous problem called the “secretary problem.”",
